OL,3,GNEWSAThe lifesaving decision that
OL,4,Auncovered my cancer
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe said: "Nothing prepares you for a
OL,7,Fcancer diagnosis but the team were
OL,8,Ffantastic and very reassuring. They
OL,9,Fcould tell me right away that they'd
OL,10,Ffound it early and that it would be
OL,11,Feasy to treat."
